<title>POLAND: STOMIL MAY NET FLAT AT PLN 3.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL MAY NET FLAT AT PLN 3.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.74 vs   3.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.91 vs   5.55</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.28 vs   6.03</p>
<p> Sales		   57.42 vs  56.07</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    23.76 vs  19.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	32.08 vs  31.72</p>
<p> Operating profit    37.39 vs  28.27</p>
<p> Sales		  274.54 vs 256.72</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Stomil Olsztyn SA.</p>
